        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You create an emoji so bright that it wears sunshades to protect itself from its own light. Creatures in the area when you cast the spell or that start their turn in the area must attempt a Fortitude saving throw. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the area up to 30 feet.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune to blinding emoji for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Blinded] until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is blinded for 1 minute.</p>"
